OL,3,AFrance is divided over who to blame for
OL,4,Aand what to learn from weekend riots
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is not the face of France! You
OL,7,Fmedia all focus on the violence and
OL,8,Fdestruction of Saturday's protests. But
OL,9,Fthat's not the majority. It's not 'us'.
OL,10,FThat's not France!"
OL,12,FElisabeth was speaking to me in front
OL,13,Fof a row of smashed shop windows,
OL,14,Fshattered glass still littering the
OL,15,Ftree-lined Parisian street. Its walls
OL,16,Fwere daubed with red-lettered graffiti
OL,17,Finsulting French police and signed with
OL,18,Fthe date of the riots, 17 October.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
